# Pre-audit item 4 (2026-09-03): byte-deterministic checkouts.
#
# Without this file, checkout bytes depend on each machine's
# core.autocrlf: the same commit checks out as CRLF on some machines
# and LF on others. The evidence ledger fingerprints file bytes, so a
# fresh clone failed the evidence gate (and the authority baseline)
# on an otherwise identical tree. Forcing LF makes every checkout
# byte-identical everywhere, which is what content fingerprints assume.
* text=auto eol=lf
